abstract: >-
  Reproducible framework for evaluating and documenting Large Language Model (LLM)
  behavior under the Systematic Excellence Protocol (SEP), a structured four-phase
  workflow (Analysis, Planning, Execution, and Telemetry/Feedback) grounded in Design
  Science Research Methodology (DSRM), the PDCA cycle, and Chaos Engineering across
  clinical triage, software refactoring, nursing safety education, and adversarial prompts.
